Quick File Manager (quickfile)
===============================

The backend binary /usr/bin/quickfile is built from the upstream source
project "quickfile":

  project : https://git.cooluc.com/sbwml/quickfile
  version : 2.0.9
  source  : https://r2.cooluc.com/source/quickfile-src-2.0.9.tar.xz
  sha256  : f73204997e3a572f05e303be1cfb7bb82a03bd3a2a5052a9b9d3217a00233f3b

License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

The binary is compiled by this repository's CI from the upstream source
tarball at the hash above; it is not a prebuilt upstream artifact. The
build uses the Rust target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl and bundles the xz
decompressor (lzma-sys "static" feature), so the resulting binary is
statically linked and needs no additional shared libraries.

The source tarball's own LICENSE file (Apache-2.0) is shipped verbatim as
LICENSE next to this notice.

The LuCI frontend (menu entry and the iframe view) is part of the upstream
project as well and is redistributed unchanged under the same license.
